    <briefdescription>
<para>Structure defining the properties of a directional cone. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Sounds will play at gain 1 when they are positioned within the inner angle of the cone. Sounds will play at <computeroutput>outerGain</computeroutput> when they are positioned outside the outer angle of the cone. The gain declines linearly from 1 to <computeroutput>outerGain</computeroutput> as the sound moves from the inner angle to the outer angle. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
